    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "What did you do?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia",
        "text": "A little surprise."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia",
        "text": "Remember how I asked you what to do after the hostages are rescued?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia",
        "text": "I did agree with you that I should take everyone with me and leave, but then it came to me I still had that bomb."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia",
        "text": "So I thought I'd give them a little surprise."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia",
        "text": "Care for a drink?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Interesting time for such a display of aesthetics."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia",
        "text": "I didn't notice this until I got the boat out here. Figured I'd try my hand at arranging it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Sounds lame."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia",
        "text": "Talking about yourself?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I can't tell for sure whether you did that intentionally or not."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia",
        "text": "What?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Have you forgotten already? 'When it comes time for you to take over, you can't always do as they did in the past.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "The call was still connected when you said that."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "So, be straight with me. You didn't do what I think you did, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia",
        "text": "We're almost to the shore."
